Also remember that default lojban will pronounce the second-from-last 
syllable with more emphasis. I'd write your name as something like:

xonGOS.JUN.itciros

or
xonGOS.JUN.iTCIros

or maybe just the vowels:
xongOs.jUn.itcIros
or maybe you'd like to emphasize/stress some other syllables.

mi'e snan


